import forgelib as F
G = F.make(slug="the-forge-christmas-event", order=20, kw="the forge christmas event",
 title="The Forge Christmas Event Guide: Santa Quests & Tickets",
 h1="The Forge Christmas Event: Santa's Quests, Xmas Tickets and the Christmas Pickaxe",
 desc="The Forge Christmas event explained: Santa's three daily quests, Xmas Tickets per quest, the Christmas Pickaxe and Potion, and what to do now it's over.",
 kw2=["the forge christmas event","the forge santa quests","the forge xmas tickets","the forge christmas pickaxe","the forge winter event"],
 related=["the-forge-island-3-guide","the-forge-updates","the-forge-codes","the-forge-prismatic-pickaxe"],
 ids=["fq-Tw4FcJpU","Hkcg3XtcwiM","2vAt7hl2krU"],
 lead="<strong>The Forge Christmas event</strong> of 2025 ran on the Frostspire Expanse alongside the Winter Expansion, and Fridge posted three guides on finishing it fast. The event has <strong>ended</strong>, but this page keeps a full record of how it worked, checked against the Forge Wiki, in case it returns this December.",
 heading="Watch Fridge's Christmas Event Videos",
 sections=[
 ("status","Is the Christmas Event Still Live?","""<div class="callout"><strong>No.</strong> The Forge Wiki lists Santa as \"Limited-Time (Event Ended)\". The current seasonal update is version 1.09, Halloween &amp; Guilds, released October 20, 2026. If a 2026 Christmas event goes live, we'll update this page, so check back in December.</div>"""),
 ("santa","Where Santa Was","""<p>Santa sat on a golden throne on a <strong>festive boat behind the player spawn, by the harbor</strong> on the Frostspire Expanse (Island 3, level 70+). He ran the event's quests and its shop.</p>"""),
 ("quests","Santa's Three Daily Quests","""<div class="table-wrap"><table><caption>Christmas event quests (Forge Wiki)</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Quest</th><th scope="col">Objective</th><th scope="col">Xmas Tickets</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>Santa's Workshop Warm-Up</td><td>Forge 3 armor and 3 weapons</td><td>140</td></tr>
<tr><td>Mine Rocks</td><td>Mine 50 Icy Pebbles</td><td>120</td></tr>
<tr><td>Santa's Pest Control</td><td>Kill 25 Crystal Spiders and 5 Diamond Spiders</td><td>160</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>The quests reset <strong>24 hours after you completed them</strong>, so doing all three every day earned <strong>420 Xmas Tickets</strong>. Fridge's \"farm points fast\" video shows his order. The forging quest was the quickest if you had spare ore, and the spiders in the Frost Webs cave covered the third.</p>"""),
 ("rewards","What the Tickets Bought","""<ul><li><strong>Christmas Pickaxe</strong>: 3,600 Xmas Tickets. It has 550 Mine Power, +72% Luck and 3 rune slots, with Exotic rarity. That's about 9 days of all three quests.</li><li><strong>Christmas Potion</strong> (event only): +25% Mining Speed, +20% Mining Damage and +25% Luck for 900 seconds.</li><li>Some Frostspire forge recipes were tied to the Santa event, according to Pro Game Guides.</li></ul>
<p>If you missed it, the <a href="the-forge-prismatic-pickaxe.html">Prismatic Pickaxe</a> matches the Christmas Pickaxe's +72% Luck with more Mine Power, and it's always available.</p>"""),
 ("prep","How to Prepare If It Returns","""<p>If the next The Forge Christmas event uses the same format, you can get ahead now:</p>
<ul><li><strong>Stockpile ore</strong> so you can finish the forging quest straight away each day.</li><li><strong>Unlock the Frostspire Expanse</strong> (level 70+) before December, because the 2025 event lived there.</li><li><strong>Upgrade your weapon</strong> so the spider quest goes fast. Crystal and Diamond Spiders live in the Frost Webs cave.</li><li><strong>Log in daily.</strong> The quests reset 24 hours after you finish them, so missing a day costs 420 tickets.</li></ul>"""),
 ("now","What to Do Instead Right Now","""<ul><li>Redeem the current codes for 45 free rerolls: <a href="the-forge-codes.html">The Forge codes</a>.</li><li>Do the Island 3 progression in our <a href="the-forge-island-3-guide.html">Frostspire Expanse guide</a>.</li><li>Follow what changed since the event in our <a href="the-forge-updates.html">The Forge update history</a>.</li></ul>""")],
 faq=[("Is The Forge Christmas event still going?","No. The 2025 Christmas event has ended, and the Forge Wiki lists Santa as limited-time."),
      ("How many Xmas Tickets did the Christmas Pickaxe cost?","3,600 Xmas Tickets."),
      ("Where was Santa in The Forge?","On a festive boat behind the Frostspire Expanse spawn, by the harbor.")],
 sources=[F.wiki("Santa"),F.wiki("Christmas_Pickaxe","Christmas Pickaxe"),F.wiki("Items","Items (Christmas Potion)"),F.wiki("Version_History","Version History"),("Pro Game Guides: Frostspire Expanse POIs","https://progameguides.com/roblox/the-forge-map-all-islands-locations-level-requirements/")])
